, "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le15ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hi, Claire. It's a good thing you're here in the copy room. If you wouldn't mind answering some of my questions.<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: Hi, Adam. Sure. What would you like to know?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I've wondered if the printers are switched off at the end of the workday.<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: Not every day, just on Friday.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hmm ...  We need to switch printers off at the end of the workday if possible. Personal printers in offices must be turned off when not in use for extended periods as well. Even in standby mode they are consuming energy and costing us money!<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: You'll have to talk to Ms. Moore about this. I don't make these decisions.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le15ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  Hmm ... there are quite a few environmentally friendly features like the ability to print double-sided. That is a must! I'll be mentioning that in my report.  Now, let's look at the photocopier over here.<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: Adam, you mustn't be touching that.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm going to jot this down. I'll be looking into the installation of software that automatically turns the machine off at a certain time and then automatically turns it on at a preset time in the morning.  We needn't have it powered up all night. Sorry, sorry!<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: It's fine. If you would let me know what you're looking for, I would be more than happy to help you.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I would appreciate it if you would tell me whether the standby is set properly on this machine.<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: I think it's automatic ...", "id": 2, "time": "34500", "image": "engenn10le15ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: It's not manual? Has this photocopier been replaced?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: This was the one we got when we moved into this office.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: It doesn't look like there are many energy efficient features. If it takes an exceptionally long time to warm up after being in standby mode, then there's no use. We must make sure the features are also practical.<br><span class=\"strong\">Claire</span>: What is this all for?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:\nI will be putting together a presentation.  I would be grateful if you would make copies of this document for me as soon as possible, and in any event, not later than tomorrow morning.", "id": 3, "time": "81500", "image": "engenn10le15ob03re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le15ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le15ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}